==Russian==

===Verb===
'''издаваться''' (izdavát’s’a) {{impf}}, [[издаться]] (izdát’s’a) {{pf}} (reflexive of ''[[издавать]]/[[издать]]'')''

# to be [[publish]]ed, be [[print]]ed
# to be [[edit]]ed
# to be [[issue]]d, be [[promulgate]]d, be [[enact]]ed
# to be [[utter]]ed, be [[emit]]ted, be [[exhale]]d

